{"4812150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Survival Code", "steam_appid": 4812150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [5085530], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVAL_CODE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A simulation runs for reasons it won't explain. You are the construct inside it, fighting wave after wave of malware with no briefing, no goal, no promised ending — just the growing certainty that survival is the only path to the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4812150/extras/50605c08089abcaaf9f8465c5214d098.poster.avif?t=1788068324\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4812150/extras/50605c08089abcaaf9f8465c5214d098.webm?t=1788068324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4812150/extras/50605c08089abcaaf9f8465c5214d098.mp4?t=1788068324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i>Auto-firing Functions by default, freeing you to focus on movement and trigger timing.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 distinct constructs, each with its own energy-gated trigger and playstyle - reflect projectiles, double your output, clear the screen with a shockwave.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 malware threats, each with a readable tell - charging tanks, segmented worms, projectile-spraying viruses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive 20 escalating waves, from a lone probe to a screen flooded with hundreds of threats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time-based survival - outlast the clock, don't chase a kill count.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4812150/extras/7e29c281579fb6a1e6beae5ea67787d1.poster.avif?t=1788068324\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4812150/extras/7e29c281579fb6a1e6beae5ea67787d1.webm?t=1788068324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4812150/extras/7e29c281579fb6a1e6beae5ea67787d1.mp4?t=1788068324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UPGRADE</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A node-based upgrade system where the upgrade screen is a circuit board - drop signal nodes on a grid and wire them by color to route stats into your build.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two separate grids: one reshapes your Construct, one reshapes your Function, so character and weapon evolve independently.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend Code Parts in the shop between waves: buy nodes and modifier chips, lock what you want, reroll what you don't.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wire it right. Survive to victory.</h2>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVAL_CODE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A simulation runs for reasons it won't explain. You are the construct inside it, fighting wave after wave of malware with no briefing, no goal, no promised ending — just the growing certainty that survival is the only path to the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4812150/extras/50605c08089abcaaf9f8465c5214d098.poster.avif?t=1788068324\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4812150/extras/50605c08089abcaaf9f8465c5214d098.webm?t=1788068324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4812150/extras/50605c08089abcaaf9f8465c5214d098.mp4?t=1788068324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i>Auto-firing Functions by default, freeing you to focus on movement and trigger timing.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 distinct constructs, each with its own energy-gated trigger and playstyle - reflect projectiles, double your output, clear the screen with a shockwave.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 malware threats, each with a readable tell - charging tanks, segmented worms, projectile-spraying viruses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive 20 escalating waves, from a lone probe to a screen flooded with hundreds of threats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time-based survival - outlast the clock, don't chase a kill count.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4812150/extras/7e29c281579fb6a1e6beae5ea67787d1.poster.avif?t=1788068324\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4812150/extras/7e29c281579fb6a1e6beae5ea67787d1.webm?t=1788068324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4812150/extras/7e29c281579fb6a1e6beae5ea67787d1.mp4?t=1788068324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UPGRADE</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A node-based upgrade system where the upgrade screen is a circuit board - drop signal nodes on a grid and wire them by color to route stats into your build.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two separate grids: one reshapes your Construct, one reshapes your Function, so character and weapon evolve independently.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend Code Parts in the shop between waves: buy nodes and modifier chips, lock what you want, reroll what you don't.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wire it right. Survive to victory.</h2>", "short_description": "Survival Code is a top-down survival shooter where you are a security construct fighting off waves of malware inside simulation. The simulation seeks the perfect build - so between waves you wire stats through a grid of signal nodes, reshaping yourself until one construct survives to victory.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4812150/92951a4d907987408f85c47b905d9e4c09b64b45/header.jpg?t=1788068324", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4812150/dfae5567a479d64bd1a57f5004287ae77539c1ad/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788068324", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4812150/dfae5567a479d64bd1a57f5004287ae77539c1ad/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788068324", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-4130 / AMD equivalent (dual-core, 64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2048 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated graphics with OpenGL 3.3 support<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 250 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 (quad-core) / AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4096 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Dedicated GPU or modern integrated graphics<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 250 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</str